/T (The electric vehicle \(EV\) industry is one of the fastest-growing sectors of the automotive market, driven by environmental awareness, government incentives, better battery technology and demand for sustainable transport. The industry produces large volumes of data on sales, pricing, battery specifications, manufacturing locations, customer ratings and sustainability.)
