82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 54 0 R
/T (This project turns that data into an interactive Tableau Public dashboard of nine visualisations. The dataset \(ev_market_test.csv\) has 100,000 vehicle records and 37 columns covering 200 manufacturers, 15 vehicle categories, 5 battery technologies, 10 manufacturing countries and 7 market regions, with model years from 2018 to 2026. The dashboard serves three stakeholder scenarios: a market strategy director, a business intelligence manager and a sustainable mobility researcher.)
/E (This project turns that data into an interactive Tableau Public dashboard of nine visualisations. The dataset \(ev_market_test.csv\) has 100,000 vehicle records and 37 columns covering 200 manufacturers, 15 vehicle categories, 5 battery technologies, 10 manufacturing countries and 7 market regions, with model years from 2018 to 2026. The dashboard serves three stakeholder scenarios: a market strategy director, a business intelligence manager and a sustainable mobility researcher.)
