/Title (The electric vehicle \(EV\) industry is one of the fastest-growing sectors of the automotive market, driven by environmental awareness, government incentives, better battery technology and demand for sustainable transport. The industry produces large volumes of data on sales, pricing, battery specifications, manufacturing locations, customer ratings and sustainability.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 514 0 R
/Next 574 0 R
>>
endobj
574 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project turns that data into an interactive Tableau Public dashboard of nine visualisations. The dataset \(ev_market_test.csv\) has 100,000 vehicle records and 37 columns covering 200 manufacturers, 15 vehicle categories, 5 battery technologies, 10 manufacturing countries and 7 market regions, with model years from 2018 to 2026. The dashboard serves three stakeholder scenarios: a market strategy director, a business intelligence manager and a sustainable mobility researcher.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 514 0 R
/Prev 573 0 R
>>
endobj
