/Title (The dashboard shows an EV market that is fragmented, with no manufacturer holding more than a small share, and with demand led by Two-Wheeler Scooters and mainstream cars rather than commercial vehicles. NMC and LFP are the two main battery technologies, while Sodium-Ion and Solid-State already hold a combined 16.8% of vehicles. Customer ratings are almost identical across categories and do not rise with price, and larger batteries do not automatically mean longer range. Commercial vehicles sell the)
